===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-}}
From {{der|ru|sla-pro|*(j)ěsti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*ēs-ti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-||to eat}}. Cognates include {{cog|grc|ἔδω}}, {{cog|la|edō}}, {{cog|sa|अत्ति|tr=átti|}}, {{cog|lt|ė́sti||to eat (of animals), to swallow, to gobble}}, {{cog|hit|sc=Xsux|𒂊𒀉𒈪|tr=eidmi||I eat}}, {{cog|ang|etan}} (English {{m|en|eat}}).

